<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#173945">
  <title>Aktivasi Lisensi Diperlukan - ZenRadius</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="/img/icon.png" type="image/png">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.1/font/bootstrap-icons.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    html, body { height: 100%; }
    body {
      background: #173945;
      background-image:
        radial-gradient(circle at 8% 0%, #236060 0%, transparent 34%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 100% 100%, #173e4d 0%, transparent 42%),
        linear-gradient(135deg, #173740 0%, #183f51 52%, #194251 100%);
      color: #f8fafc;
      min-height: 100vh;
      min-height: 100dvh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
      padding: 24px;
    }

    /* ── Card (Selaras dengan Login & Keymaker) ── */
    .lock-card {
      background: #173945;
      border: 1px solid rgba(190, 239, 255, .28);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 38px 32px 28px;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 440px;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 48px rgba(3, 14, 20, .45);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .brand-icon { margin-bottom: 18px; }
    .brand-icon img { width: 210px; max-width: 80%; height: auto; display: block; margin: 0 auto; }

    .lock-card h3 {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #fff;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .lock-card h3 i { color: #f59e0b; filter: drop-shadow(0 0 8px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.4)); }

    .lock-copy {
      color: rgba(237, 250, 250, .7);
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin: 8px auto 20px;
      max-width: 350px;
    }

    /* ── Domain Badge ── */
    .domain-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      background: rgba(45, 212, 191, .08);
      border: 1px solid rgba(45, 212, 191, .25);
      padding: 8px 16px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-family: ui-monospace, Consolas, monospace;
      color: #2dd4bf;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      word-break: break-all;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    /* ── Steps List ── */
    .steps-container {
      width: 100%;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, .22);
      border: 1px solid rgba(190, 239, 255, .1);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
      text-align: left;
    }
    .steps-container ol {
      padding-left: 20px;
      color: rgba(237, 250, 250, .75);
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .steps-container li { margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .steps-container li:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .steps-container strong { color: #fff; }

    /* ── Alert Match Error ── */
    .alert-mismatch {
      width: 100%;
      background: rgba(239, 68, 68, .08);
      border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, .25);
      color: #fca5a5;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 12px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      text-align: left;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    /* ── Action Buttons ── */
    .actions-grid {
      width: 100%;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .btn {
      width: 100%;
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px;
      padding: 11px 18px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; font-family: inherit;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all .2s ease;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    /* Primary button (settings) */
    .btn-primary {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #236060 0%, #183f51 52%, #194251 100%);
      color: #f4fffd;
      border: 1px solid rgba(126, 231, 219, .48);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(10, 41, 50, .24);
    }
    .btn-primary:hover {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2d7774 0%, #1d5264 52%, #205b68 100%);
      border-color: rgba(166, 247, 235, .72);
      color: #fff;
    }

    /* Secondary button (whatsapp) */
    .btn-whatsapp {
      background: rgba(16, 185, 129, .1);
      color: #34d399;
      border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, .25);
    }
    .btn-whatsapp:hover {
      background: rgba(16, 185, 129, .2);
      border-color: #34d399;
      color: #fff;
    }

    /* ── Footer ── */
    .agent-footer {
      width: 100%;
      margin-top: 24px; padding-top: 14px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(124, 221, 218, .15);
      color: rgba(237, 250, 250, .56);
      font-size: 11px; text-align: center;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <main class="lock-card" role="main">
    <div class="brand-icon">
      <img src="/img/logo.png?v=zenradius" alt="ZenRadius" onerror="this.src='/img/icon.png'">
    </div>

    <h3><i class="bi bi-shield-lock-fill"></i> Aktivasi Lisensi</h3>
    <p class="lock-copy">Untuk terus menikmati seluruh fungsionalitas dan pemantauan jaringan premium, instansi ZenRadius ini memerlukan lisensi domain aktif.</p>

    <div class="domain-badge">
      <i class="bi bi-globe"></i> <%= domain %>
    </div>

    <% if (hasKey) { %>
      <div class="alert-mismatch">
        <i class="bi bi-exclamation-triangle-fill"></i>
        <span>Kode lisensi yang terpasang di sistem tidak cocok dengan domain ini.</span>
      </div>
    <% } %>

    <div class="steps-container">
      <ol>
        <li>Hubungi <strong>Developer via WhatsApp</strong> untuk mendaftarkan domain Anda dan mendapatkan kunci lisensi premium seumur hidup.</li>
        <li>Login sebagai Super Admin, buka menu <strong>Akses Role / Pengaturan → Lisensi</strong>.</li>
        <li>Tempel kode kunci lisensi tersebut, lalu simpan pengaturan.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="actions-grid">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/admin/settings">
        <i class="bi bi-gear-fill"></i> Masukkan Lisensi Sekarang
      </a>
      <a class="btn btn-whatsapp" href="https://wa.me/6281234567890?text=Halo%20Developer%20ZenRadius,%20saya%20ingin%20meminta%20kunci%20lisensi%20premium%20seumur%20hidup%20untuk%20domain%20<%= encodeURIComponent(domain) %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <i class="bi bi-whatsapp"></i> Hubungi WhatsApp Developer
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="agent-footer">&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> ZenRadius &middot; Premium Carrier Billing</div>
  </main>

</body>
</html>
